5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to understand why the current layout is failing. I suggest looking into the morning departures and the rain exposure to see the physical reality.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree we need data. I want to check the building account's ledger and the ward cycle park's rates to understand the financial context.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,Fairness is my concern. I'll look at the five years of association minutes and the sticker register to see who actually uses the spaces.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm worried about resident friction. I'll check the last year's complaint log and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know who does the work! I'll check the treasurer's handover file and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, do you think the cost is the primary driver here, or is it the lack of a formal system?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It's both. We can't propose a solution without knowing if we have funds or if residents can afford alternatives.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, do you think the complaints are about the people or the spaces themselves?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Likely both, George. The environment often dictates the behavior.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I just hope we don't pick something that makes one person do all the paperwork!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
